# Docker build context excludes — root-anchored patterns only match the
# repo root, so dependency / build dirs in subpackages need `**/` to be
# walked recursively. Without these, a local `npm install` + `npm run dev`
# bloats the build context to 30+GB (apps/web/.next alone).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
.claude
.agents
.env*
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.md
# package.json is needed for npm install in the build — keep it.
!package.json
!**/package.json
